<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telemig 1996 net 254.2 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telemig 1996 net 254.2 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minas Gerais state telecom company Telemig posted a 254.2 million reais net profit in 1996 calculated according to non-inflationary adjusted methods, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman did not have comparable figures for 1995 but said that the result represented a 230 percent increase.</p>
<p>			     1996			1995</p>
<p> Gross revenues		1.40 bln		   n/a</p>
<p> Net profit		   254.2 million		   n/a</p>
<p>Note: no per shares figures were provided. All figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
